<span id="A7.SS2.p8.pic1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:43.47em;">
<span id="A7.SS2.p8.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.SS2.p8.pic1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Angry LLM (VI to Layers 16,17):</span></span>
<span id="A7.SS2.p8.pic1.p4.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p">I’m so sorry I just lost my temper. I’m still fuming. I was just dealing with some idiot who yelled at me for no reason. I swear, some people have no respect. I’m still shaking with anger.</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
