Evaluation of the trustworthiness tasks on <span id="A9.F24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Llama3.1-8B-Instruct</span> with different OCEAN personalities using the Prompting methods.
</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
